  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "くさを　からませて　あいてを\nころばせる。あいてが　おもいほど\nいりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "풀을 휘감아서 상대를\n쓰러뜨린다. 상대가 무거울수록\n위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用打結的草絆倒對手。\n對手越重，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "L’ennemi est piégé dans de l’herbe qui le fait trébucher.\nPlus il est lourd, plus il subit de dégâts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ziel wird durch Gras ins Straucheln gebracht.\nJe schwerer das Ziel, desto mehr Schaden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Enreda al objetivo con hierba y lo derriba. Cuanto más\npesado es el objetivo, más daño inflige. ",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa intrappola il bersaglio con l’erba e lo fa\ncadere. Danneggia maggiormente i Pokémon\npiù pesanti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user snares the target with grass and trips it.\nThe heavier the target, the greater the\nmove’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "草を　からませて　相手を\n転ばせる。相手が　重いほど\n威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用草缠住并绊倒对手。\n对手越重，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Enreda al objetivo con hierba y lo derriba. Cuanto más\npesado es el objetivo, más daño inflige.",
      "version_group": {
